9. PRIVACY

   OZFA Disk Control collects no telemetry and sends nothing anywhere by default. The only
   outbound connections it can make are to a shared library server whose address you enter
   yourself, and to the public releases feed to check for a newer version. Neither is enabled with
   any personal data, and neither sends anything about you, your machine or your disks.
